pub const AGENTS_NOTE : str = "docs/agents/AGENTS_ALPHABET.md \"Who holds a tool, and who holds a skill\" binds every tool to the Queen (T). Domain lead C: ABOUT is \"The specs the compiler reads WRONGLY, and which of them a gate refuses.\" and misread.rs shows specs that pass parse and generate while \"the Rust backend writes `pub bad: 0,` and the C backend writes `0 bad;`, both unparseable\" -- C's exit invariant \"Generated code compiles\" violated. Since #3225 typecheck refuses three of the five shapes, so each pair is reported as refused or silent; only a silent one violates it with every gate green.";
